{"id":"wb-6-817","name":"金灯寺石窟","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"金灯寺石窟","text":"金灯寺石窟是位于中华人民共和国山西省平顺县杏城镇背泉村的一座石窟寺，地处与河南省林州市交界的林虑山巅，是中国最大的明代石窟群，为全国重点文物保护单位。金灯寺海拔1500余米，全年有三个季节山雾弥漫，寺院时隐时现，有“中州之蓬莱，晋豫之奇观”之称。\n金灯寺现有殿堂式石窟、摩崖造像、碑刻等遗存。现存石窟开凿于明朝，是中国传统佛教石窟营造进入晚期后的重要遗存。石窟承唐、宋遗风，又兼具明朝的时代特点，被称为“中国石窟艺术尾声的巅峰之作”\n。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%87%91%E7%81%AF%E5%AF%BA%E7%9F%B3%E7%AA%9F","revisionId":94713349,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94713349","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/7afb32bcf565f972e562cf79.jpg","title":"20260827_Jindeng_Temple_18.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20260827_Jindeng_Temple_18.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/58/20260827_Jindeng_Temple_18.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​全国重点文物保护单位 山西平顺 金灯寺石窟","width":320,"height":213}}